# Who has to look at a change before it merges.
#
# Everything in this repository is owned by the maintainer, but these paths are
# called out because a change to any of them is a change to what runs
# automatically, with credentials, or to what the site publishes about real people:
#
#   .github/  — the workflows themselves, and the secret they are trusted with
#   scripts/  — what those workflows execute
#   data/     — the squads and Internationals the public site serves

*                   @RecklessReef-ai
/.github/           @RecklessReef-ai
/scripts/           @RecklessReef-ai
/data/              @RecklessReef-ai
